WEBVTT

00:00:15.270 --> 00:00:17.200
Episode 7

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:38.200
Project coordinator and song translator: Nemie

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:48.300
Translators: tamaramin, Kaia, Nemie

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:58.400
Beta Editor: Sana

00:00:53.980 --> 00:00:56.460
Even if you almost became His Majesty's woman,

00:00:56.460 --> 00:00:58.960
but since you ended up here, now you're just a servant

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:08.500
Typesetters: Nemie, Sana

00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:01.930
Yes I know that

00:01:01.930 --> 00:01:05.070
I'll get used to it quickly

00:01:05.070 --> 00:01:07.060
Do you know how to brew tea?

00:01:07.060 --> 00:01:09.610
Use medicinal herbs and know how to add color to your face?

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:12.290
This is exactly what I am strongest at

00:01:12.290 --> 00:01:13.860
I am a licensed skin care technician.

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:14.960
And I know how to make your face brighter

00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:17.170
I can also make various toiletries

00:01:17.590 --> 00:01:21.010
I think Damiwon Palace suits me

00:01:21.010 --> 00:01:24.940
Can you read and write?

00:01:24.940 --> 00:01:27.890
No

00:01:31.560 --> 00:01:34.840
You really can’t?

00:01:40.410 --> 00:01:42.870
Are you still here?

00:01:44.770 --> 00:01:46.470
From the very beginning I was curious about this place.

00:01:46.470 --> 00:01:48.720
And now it’s so easy to see everything

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:50.900
I can do a lot of things

00:01:50.900 --> 00:01:53.110
And, do you know that I am a master at adding color to my face?

00:01:53.110 --> 00:01:55.370
Didn't you know?

00:01:55.370 --> 00:02:00.580
Well, now I have entered the palace.
You should come here for a walk more often

00:02:00.580 --> 00:02:02.560
By the way

00:02:02.560 --> 00:02:05.280
I was so scared that day

00:02:05.280 --> 00:02:09.590
And I completely forgot to thank you

00:02:09.590 --> 00:02:14.500
But still, you did not allow me to marry His Majesty. This is such happiness!

00:02:22.010 --> 00:02:25.330
You could have died

00:02:25.330 --> 00:02:29.210
If the wound had been deeper, you would have died!

00:02:29.210 --> 00:02:32.800
But I'm alive

00:02:32.800 --> 00:02:38.060
The scar on your body... Do you know what it means?

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:40.170
Are you glad that you became a maid in the palace?

00:02:40.170 --> 00:02:43.500
You will stay here for the rest of your life and won’t even be able to leave!

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:45.670
Are you still having fun?

00:02:45.670 --> 00:02:48.430
Why did you do this?

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:50.030
Is it better than becoming the emperor's woman?

00:02:50.030 --> 00:02:52.830
Don't know! I really don’t know!

00:02:54.030 --> 00:02:56.210
"As a last resort..."

00:02:56.210 --> 00:02:59.400
"Closing my eyes, I will share the bed with the emperor"

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:02.360
That's what I thought

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:07.730
But I couldn't handle it

00:03:08.070 --> 00:03:10.640
Save yourself...

00:03:10.640 --> 00:03:14.930
only I can do it myself

00:03:14.930 --> 00:03:19.090
With this thought in mind, I did just that.

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:24.180
But by the time I woke up...

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:27.290
Here's how it turned out

00:03:28.020 --> 00:03:31.170
You're so stupid

00:03:35.270 --> 00:03:38.960
Don't do that again

00:03:39.270 --> 00:03:43.070
Otherwise I will never forgive you

00:03:54.770 --> 00:03:58.450
What kind of place is this?

00:03:58.450 --> 00:04:01.230
This is Dongzhi Lake

00:04:01.230 --> 00:04:04.730
The best place to watch the first rays of the sun

00:04:04.730 --> 00:04:09.590
Palace... what is this place?

00:04:09.590 --> 00:04:14.000
It's not easy to get in here, and it's even harder to get out.

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:16.020
If you trust anyone here, you will die,

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:20.330
and if you are afraid of those who are close, you will survive

00:04:20.330 --> 00:04:22.610
This is such a place

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:27.290
It seems that you, prince, do not understand everything

00:04:27.290 --> 00:04:29.960
Everyone here is lonely

00:04:29.960 --> 00:04:32.930
This I understand

00:04:51.510 --> 00:04:55.690
I'm not alone, so it's okay

00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:58.590
Not alone?

00:04:58.590 --> 00:05:03.320
The prince is with me! Why am I alone?

00:05:03.970 --> 00:05:06.200
Every day you become braver

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:10.630
Still, there are places here too where people come to stand and think.

00:05:10.630 --> 00:05:16.160
So I will definitely endure everything

00:05:17.840 --> 00:05:20.450
Of course

00:05:20.450 --> 00:05:22.920
With the appearance of one lively man

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:26.390
my life in the palace has become less boring

00:05:51.400 --> 00:05:52.810
Brother

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:58.490
I asked them to find a new pair for you

00:06:00.320 --> 00:06:03.490
Regarding political marriage... one is more than enough

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:06.660
Should I kill them then?

00:06:07.330 --> 00:06:08.700
Or, as before,

00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:14.900
will we run back and forth from Empress Yu, wandering from place to place?

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:19.680
Yong Hwa, I forgot about this. Mother too

00:06:19.680 --> 00:06:22.410
No, you should do the same

00:06:22.700 --> 00:06:27.550
Look at the 3rd brother, he married the daughter of Prime Minister Park Kyung Kyu

00:06:27.550 --> 00:06:31.190
He even expanded his power thanks to Hubaekje, increasing his chance of taking the throne

00:06:32.150 --> 00:06:35.120
If the Empress throws out the Crown Prince,

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:37.000
our future is obvious

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:39.590
Either we die or we'll be on the run

00:06:39.590 --> 00:06:42.360
Are you asking me to forget about it? How?

00:06:45.570 --> 00:06:49.510
What about you? Thought you liked So

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:58.210
Not only the 4th brother, but also someone else who is targeting the throne

00:06:58.210 --> 00:07:00.250
Whether it's a political marriage or a marriage of convenience...

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:05.050
I will only enter into a marriage that will help you

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:11.730
Yong Hwa... Can you stop and live freely?

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:15.960
There's only one way to live free

00:07:16.600 --> 00:07:19.370
Become an emperor brother

00:07:30.450 --> 00:07:34.120
I missed the morning meeting again due to illness.

00:07:35.520 --> 00:07:37.860
Of course, there will be many requests to remove my title

00:07:37.860 --> 00:07:43.530
Everyone lives with their illnesses.
Don't blame yourself so much

00:07:43.530 --> 00:07:46.560
I feel like a burden because of this disease

00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:49.930
Hungry for the throne, I'm where I shouldn't be

00:07:51.100 --> 00:07:56.100
As I already told you, you were born to be an emperor

00:07:56.110 --> 00:07:58.510
Why would I fool people in Goryeo?

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:03.080
Please focus on getting better.

00:08:13.980 --> 00:08:16.740
General!

00:08:20.910 --> 00:08:23.310
Fine! At ease! At ease!

00:08:23.310 --> 00:08:24.620
- Do you know the service?
- Yes

00:08:24.620 --> 00:08:27.160
Well done, well done

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:34.100
Everything is still dazzling and magnificent

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:40.860
Father asked... And you will die, but you will stand your ground

00:08:40.860 --> 00:08:42.970
Where did you put the bear bile?

00:08:40.860 --> 00:08:44.600
*Considered an aphrodisiac

00:08:42.970 --> 00:08:44.840
She's not only yours

00:08:44.840 --> 00:08:51.560
Are you serious? As a child, I brought all the most delicious and valuable things to my beloved father.

00:09:03.940 --> 00:09:07.910
His Majesty's humble servant Pak respectfully arrived in the capital

00:09:07.910 --> 00:09:11.620
You have arrived, General

00:09:22.430 --> 00:09:26.710
Your faithful servant had to first bathe and change clothes. I apologize to the Emperor

00:09:26.710 --> 00:09:33.060
You were forbidden to enter the capital for a long time.
I remain in your debt for this unwise decision.

00:09:33.060 --> 00:09:41.210
The 4th prince's intelligence is superior to others.
It was a joy to teach him the craft of war

00:09:41.210 --> 00:09:48.080
If it weren't for that scar, he would be in no way inferior to the crown prince.

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:52.550
So, the crown prince is not suitable for the art of war?

00:09:52.550 --> 00:09:59.190
Prince Wang Mu is strong with his fists, but his heart is too soft

00:09:59.190 --> 00:10:03.810
I wonder how hard it is for him to fight the political war in the palace

00:10:03.810 --> 00:10:11.190
It seems to me that in a regular war it’s even easier

00:10:17.370 --> 00:10:21.450
While in the palace you can learn a lot and advance higher in your career.

00:10:21.450 --> 00:10:23.990
What? What to study?

00:10:23.990 --> 00:10:25.730
Common sense and delicacy

00:10:25.730 --> 00:10:26.680
That is,

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:29.800
Is Prince Wang So learning these things here too?

00:10:29.800 --> 00:10:31.010
Common sense and delicacy?

00:10:31.010 --> 00:10:31.960
Just think!

00:10:31.960 --> 00:10:33.270
I don't know this

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:35.830
Come on, go

00:10:42.460 --> 00:10:46.620
Crown Prince, last time you gave me a horse on a stick. What will you reward this time?

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:47.930
If we win,

00:10:47.930 --> 00:10:50.510
you'll get any funny thing you want

00:10:50.510 --> 00:10:52.600
Don't forget, we agreed!

00:10:52.600 --> 00:10:55.410
Jeong! Come on, come on!

00:10:55.410 --> 00:11:01.240
Others are fine, but I will definitely win against you, 10th prince!

00:11:01.240 --> 00:11:04.950
I agree, I will never lose today

00:11:04.950 --> 00:11:06.320
Exactly, Jeong

00:11:06.320 --> 00:11:07.330
Just don’t use too much force

00:11:07.330 --> 00:11:08.280
- Brothers!
- Stop

00:11:08.280 --> 00:11:11.530
- Forward!
- Forward!

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:45.480
Third, when you place objects on the surface of the water...

00:11:51.820 --> 00:11:55.940
God... would you like to take a look at this?

00:11:58.230 --> 00:12:03.010
Lately you attach more importance to books than to martial arts

00:12:03.010 --> 00:12:05.780
Following your example, we are almost equal in the art of war

00:12:05.780 --> 00:12:09.200
Now you need something in your head too

00:12:09.200 --> 00:12:15.170
I heard you killed in one night
ten, and then started a fire

00:12:18.670 --> 00:12:21.310
They had to die

00:12:21.310 --> 00:12:24.690
Looks like you've read the books

00:12:24.690 --> 00:12:31.280
Learned how to recognize at first glance who should or should not die

00:12:31.280 --> 00:12:33.060
Killing living beings...

00:12:33.060 --> 00:12:41.000
No matter how many times you die and be reborn
you will still have to pay for your sins in the end

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:43.600
You taught me to kill people, General

00:12:43.600 --> 00:12:46.280
I taught you this so that you could protect people.

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:50.880
I stopped causing trouble
the imperial family, so I protect the people

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:57.500
But... Why do you want to stay in Songak?

00:12:57.500 --> 00:13:03.920
The Kang Family of Shinju... You Can Control It Completely

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:08.510
I am also a prince, I should also know this
how the state is run

00:13:08.510 --> 00:13:13.030
I wonder what it is about the title of emperor that my mother and brothers and sisters are so after it?

00:13:13.030 --> 00:13:18.980
But after watching the fun, won't you come back again?

00:13:19.990 --> 00:13:21.980
Should I go back?

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:28.360
Only one prince will remain in Songak forever

00:13:28.360 --> 00:13:31.510
The one who will take the throne

00:13:34.010 --> 00:13:36.720
Think carefully

00:13:36.720 --> 00:13:42.300
What is the real reason for your desire to stay in Songak?

00:14:04.710 --> 00:14:07.560
Has your headache gone away a little?

00:14:07.560 --> 00:14:12.760
After drinking the chrysanthemum tea you prepared, I felt a little better

00:14:12.760 --> 00:14:15.400
But it hasn't gone away for like 10 days

00:14:15.400 --> 00:14:18.180
And I don't have any hopes

00:14:18.180 --> 00:14:21.830
I ordered that incense be placed under your pillow

00:14:21.830 --> 00:14:24.760
Sound sleep is the best
medicine for headaches

00:14:24.760 --> 00:14:26.760
Thank you

00:14:26.860 --> 00:14:31.010
Su, how are you? Were you able to get used to it?

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:34.350
You entered the palace, becoming a maid.
It must be very hard for you

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:35.450
How are you doing?

00:14:35.550 --> 00:14:37.460
It's not hard for me. I'm doing very well

00:14:38.470 --> 00:14:40.050
The soap I made for you last time...

00:14:40.050 --> 00:14:42.100
If you are satisfied with it, I will make more

00:14:42.590 --> 00:14:45.090
And I can make you up

00:14:45.090 --> 00:14:47.550
This is where some tweaking needs to be done

00:14:47.550 --> 00:14:50.130
You are just a new maid, how dare you raise your head?

00:14:50.130 --> 00:14:52.760
Don't be impudent, go out

00:14:52.760 --> 00:14:56.380
Got it

00:14:59.200 --> 00:15:03.830
If you look at it, this child is really suitable for Damiwon

00:15:03.830 --> 00:15:06.420
Her handmade soap is quite good.

00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:10.190
I'll look after her

00:15:10.480 --> 00:15:12.250
By the way, how are you doing?

00:15:12.250 --> 00:15:16.580
Is Empress Yu still angry with you?

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:20.030
I don't care. Don't worry

00:15:20.030 --> 00:15:24.050
Your stomach pains are as bad as my headaches, so I'll ask you

00:15:24.050 --> 00:15:28.750
The causes of the diseases are similar. If I remain indifferent, who will take care of you?

00:15:28.750 --> 00:15:30.930
You should see the court physician

00:15:30.930 --> 00:15:35.900
Although he only treats imperial
family, but you try too

00:15:35.900 --> 00:15:42.200
I thank the queen for her great mercy

00:15:49.710 --> 00:15:51.210
Ice! Apply ice!

00:15:52.020 --> 00:15:54.070
I have insects crawling all over my body!

00:15:55.100 --> 00:15:56.900
Come up with something!

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:01.420
Doctor! Call the doctor!

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:08.060
My body is torn to pieces!

00:16:08.060 --> 00:16:09.270
Insects crawl all over your body!

00:16:09.270 --> 00:16:10.520
Ice! Bring on the cold water!

00:16:10.850 --> 00:16:12.170
I think it's an allergy

00:16:14.420 --> 00:16:15.670
You can't!

00:16:15.670 --> 00:16:16.820
- Water!
- You can’t do that!

00:16:16.960 --> 00:16:18.200
Away!

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:21.320
You can't have cold water!

00:16:21.340 --> 00:16:22.780
You don't understand anything!

00:16:23.860 --> 00:16:28.560
You ate beans or cold food and you started itching even more, right?

00:16:28.560 --> 00:16:30.790
Fatigue, profuse sweating and unbearable itching

00:16:30.790 --> 00:16:34.720
You can't wear fur and wool

00:16:35.830 --> 00:16:39.380
How do you know?

00:16:39.380 --> 00:16:41.620
Trust me

00:16:41.620 --> 00:16:46.620
You need to wash yourself with warm water.
The cold will make the itching even worse

00:16:46.620 --> 00:16:48.780
Don't have any tea leaves?

00:16:48.780 --> 00:16:49.800
Aloe or green tea?

00:16:49.800 --> 00:16:53.740
Mint leaves!

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:06.650
First let's lower the body temperature

00:17:20.360 --> 00:17:26.510
The coolness of mint leaves will help relieve itching.

00:17:32.700 --> 00:17:35.090
What are you doing?!

00:17:35.090 --> 00:17:38.030
All! Get out!

00:17:38.270 --> 00:17:39.950
Out!

00:17:39.950 --> 00:17:42.670
My mother also suffered from this, so I saw a lot of things

00:17:42.670 --> 00:17:44.900
If you wash your body above the waist...

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:48.900
You had no right to come here

00:17:48.900 --> 00:17:52.060
Concubine O

00:17:52.060 --> 00:17:55.310
Crown Prince! Are you okay?

00:17:55.750 --> 00:17:58.870
Hold your breath, calm down

00:17:58.870 --> 00:18:00.490
Please lie down on the bed

00:18:00.490 --> 00:18:03.560
Be careful, slowly

00:18:08.370 --> 00:18:10.000
Unbearable pain?

00:18:13.350 --> 00:18:14.550
"Cha Ching"

00:18:14.550 --> 00:18:18.460
This treatise was written by tea sage Lu Yu
during the Chinese Tang Dynasty

00:18:20.050 --> 00:18:21.750
"Xinxiu bencao"

00:18:21.750 --> 00:18:24.200
This book contains more than 100 medicines

00:18:25.190 --> 00:18:27.050
"Bencao shiyi"

00:18:27.890 --> 00:18:31.440
This is a book on medicinal plants written by Chen Cang Qi from the Tang Dynasty

00:18:31.440 --> 00:18:33.500
It describes their benefits

00:18:34.790 --> 00:18:38.230
If you had read these books, you would not have made a mistake today

00:18:38.230 --> 00:18:40.320
How dare you touch the crown prince?!

00:18:40.320 --> 00:18:42.340
He suffered so much...

00:18:42.340 --> 00:18:45.550
I knew how to help him, so I didn’t remain idle

00:18:47.290 --> 00:18:50.390
How did you know that mint leaves relieve itching?

00:18:50.390 --> 00:18:52.780
You're illiterate, you couldn't read it anywhere

00:18:52.780 --> 00:18:56.980
My mother had the same disease, so I am familiar with its treatment

00:18:58.330 --> 00:19:01.890
Never talk about the Crown Prince's illness

00:19:02.390 --> 00:19:04.820
Otherwise you won't live to see the sun rise

00:19:07.560 --> 00:19:08.750
Do you understand?

00:19:10.090 --> 00:19:11.170
Yes

00:19:29.790 --> 00:19:31.690
Drink!

00:19:37.430 --> 00:19:38.720
Drink

00:19:42.120 --> 00:19:44.270
And you drink

00:19:47.290 --> 00:19:48.380
Wow

00:19:50.350 --> 00:19:51.900
I didn't want to

00:19:53.340 --> 00:19:55.600
I'm not some kind of cattle

00:19:55.600 --> 00:19:58.330
I thought that a noblewoman would be treated well even here

00:19:58.330 --> 00:20:00.040
Empty hopes

00:20:02.150 --> 00:20:03.900
- Maybe we should just run away?
- Run away?

00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:08.110
Where in Goryeo can you hide from the emperor?

00:20:08.110 --> 00:20:10.890
Who, who said that I would really run away?

00:20:11.230 --> 00:20:13.740
I'm just saying it would be nice

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:19.170
You're a maid in Damiwon and you act like a minister

00:20:19.170 --> 00:20:22.990
You don't use your arms or body, just your head

00:20:22.990 --> 00:20:27.250
No matter how you look at it, this place doesn't suit me

00:20:27.250 --> 00:20:29.390
Nobody recognizes my talent

00:20:29.390 --> 00:20:31.100
I'm overwhelmed with it, yes!

00:20:31.860 --> 00:20:33.830
Have you ever demonstrated it?

00:20:34.370 --> 00:20:37.780
Even the crown prince. I did everything right, but...

00:20:40.300 --> 00:20:45.100
Still, to get recognition at work, you need a good boss

00:20:46.120 --> 00:20:48.040
Won't work this time

00:20:55.790 --> 00:20:58.710
Are you by any chance aware of the Crown Prince's illness?

00:20:58.710 --> 00:21:00.870
What?

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:03.270
I've never heard of

00:21:04.890 --> 00:21:06.590
Watch your words

00:21:06.590 --> 00:21:09.240
Next time it won't end at Damiwon

00:21:10.400 --> 00:21:12.250
You know about her too

00:21:13.870 --> 00:21:17.510
But aller... itchy skin

00:21:17.510 --> 00:21:20.790
He won't pass if he acts like he's about to die

00:21:20.790 --> 00:21:22.900
You need to take care of yourself and eat well

00:21:25.280 --> 00:21:27.670
Do you think Concubine O was trying to keep me in line?

00:21:27.670 --> 00:21:29.330
Because I can get the crown prince's patronage?

00:21:30.240 --> 00:21:33.190
What if you did worse to him?

00:21:33.190 --> 00:21:35.220
You would already be dead

00:21:35.220 --> 00:21:37.620
She let you go easily

00:21:39.820 --> 00:21:41.160
Maybe

00:21:41.160 --> 00:21:43.940
Seeing how you water the plants,

00:21:43.940 --> 00:21:46.250
you are not overflowing, but lacking talent

00:21:46.250 --> 00:21:47.260
Completely

00:21:48.170 --> 00:21:51.280
When you grow something, you need to give it a name.

00:21:51.280 --> 00:21:52.570
Make friends with him

00:21:52.570 --> 00:21:56.060
Why do I need to name plants? Even my name confuses me

00:21:59.510 --> 00:22:04.260
Oh, that pine tree is more interesting

00:22:05.030 --> 00:22:06.580
You can call it "The Best"

00:22:07.750 --> 00:22:11.470
And mulberry fruits cause people to emit gas

00:22:14.540 --> 00:22:16.260
"Stink"?

00:22:16.260 --> 00:22:19.770
Are you trying to cheer me up now?

00:22:27.630 --> 00:22:31.610
When I lived in Shinzhu, I named the birch tree Tak-tak

00:22:31.610 --> 00:22:34.580
Up to three people could hang on it, and it would not budge

00:22:34.580 --> 00:22:39.580
God, your friend must be very famous

00:22:42.330 --> 00:22:46.210
I burned it down a few years ago

00:22:46.210 --> 00:22:47.380
She's gone

00:22:48.170 --> 00:22:49.220
What?

00:22:49.920 --> 00:22:53.250
It was cold, a pack of wolves was gathering

00:23:00.230 --> 00:23:02.200
And then she caught my eye

00:23:10.720 --> 00:23:13.500
Forget it. Why am I telling you this?

00:23:17.810 --> 00:23:19.710
Don't think about escaping

00:23:19.710 --> 00:23:22.840
Be true to what you decide to do

00:23:24.050 --> 00:23:25.240
Do you understand?

00:23:25.740 --> 00:23:27.880
In order to live, you need to work

00:23:35.340 --> 00:23:37.730
He's been too kind lately

00:24:07.070 --> 00:24:12.240
I'm standing in front of you again, standing here alone

00:24:12.240 --> 00:24:15.440
Tell me with your lips

00:24:15.440 --> 00:24:18.080
Only "yes", only "yes"

00:24:18.080 --> 00:24:22.610
I don’t understand why, but I always rush to you

00:24:22.610 --> 00:24:28.710
With a breath of wind I will tell you: I love

00:24:31.890 --> 00:24:33.890
Need you!

00:24:36.460 --> 00:24:40.060
My dear, so to speak I want

00:24:40.060 --> 00:24:42.500
What I can’t say

00:24:43.200 --> 00:24:48.590
My dear, my dear, my dear: I love you!

00:24:48.960 --> 00:24:52.370
I only wish for one thing

00:24:52.370 --> 00:24:56.940
So that you will always be by my side

00:24:57.600 --> 00:25:00.680
Smile only for me, I ask

00:25:00.680 --> 00:25:02.910
Yes, listen to me, I ask

00:25:02.910 --> 00:25:08.740
And this is quite enough for me!

00:25:12.680 --> 00:25:17.980
I look at you and I smile as always

00:25:17.980 --> 00:25:21.190
Answer me quickly

00:25:21.190 --> 00:25:23.620
Only "yes", only "yes"

00:25:23.620 --> 00:25:25.460
I love you

00:25:25.460 --> 00:25:28.490
I don't mind crying sometimes

00:25:28.910 --> 00:25:35.000
My dear, my dear, my dear: I love you!

00:25:41.200 --> 00:25:44.430
Su, how long should I sit like this?

00:25:44.430 --> 00:25:46.050
Wait a little

00:25:48.650 --> 00:25:49.920
Su

00:25:50.290 --> 00:25:52.990
I feel like insects are crawling on my fingers!

00:25:52.990 --> 00:25:55.610
Just sit still and wait

00:25:55.610 --> 00:25:58.610
If the balsam petals do not change color with the first snow,

00:25:58.610 --> 00:26:00.080
then first love will come to you

00:26:00.820 --> 00:26:01.940
Really?

00:26:05.290 --> 00:26:06.800
First love?

00:26:43.490 --> 00:26:46.470
Cool day...

00:26:46.870 --> 00:26:48.180
Chun Il...

00:26:52.050 --> 00:26:55.270
Chun il... what is this?

00:26:55.270 --> 00:26:56.860
"Bon" as a peak

00:26:58.740 --> 00:27:00.280
"Chun Il Bong Hwa"

00:27:00.280 --> 00:27:03.280
"Flowers were blooming on a warm spring day"

00:27:05.940 --> 00:27:07.970
What is this?

00:27:09.250 --> 00:27:10.610
My task

00:27:11.120 --> 00:27:15.570
I can't read, so I used the wrong herbs

00:27:16.120 --> 00:27:17.730
Can't you read?

00:27:19.910 --> 00:27:21.040
Well...

00:27:21.770 --> 00:27:26.420
Honestly, I can't read after my head injury.

00:27:28.460 --> 00:27:31.600
Then how did you read the poem I gave you?

00:27:32.550 --> 00:27:34.110
My sister read it to me

00:27:35.340 --> 00:27:38.560
"The willows are green, the river water is calm"
this is a poem

00:27:42.480 --> 00:27:45.220
I have a lot to repay my wife for

00:27:45.980 --> 00:27:47.020
What?

00:27:48.980 --> 00:27:51.990
It's so difficult to meet you, I was even going to write a letter

00:27:51.990 --> 00:27:55.270
But you can't read, what now?

00:27:55.270 --> 00:27:58.580
Don't worry, I'll learn to read soon

00:28:13.770 --> 00:28:14.790
Su

00:28:34.840 --> 00:28:36.850
Write it like this

00:28:38.220 --> 00:28:39.840
This is Adonis Amur

00:28:39.840 --> 00:28:43.030
Poisonous medicinal plant,
which needs to be used correctly

00:28:47.020 --> 00:28:48.080
Yes...

00:28:51.480 --> 00:28:52.510
This...

00:29:17.850 --> 00:29:20.650
What does this mean?

00:29:21.150 --> 00:29:22.350
My name

00:29:24.970 --> 00:29:26.040
Uk

00:29:28.220 --> 00:29:30.340
Means "The rising sun in the morning"

00:29:34.530 --> 00:29:37.910
Rising sun in the morning, Uk...

00:30:06.610 --> 00:30:11.070
Red color will protect you from failures

00:30:12.040 --> 00:30:16.340
It also symbolizes joyful relationships

00:30:21.640 --> 00:30:22.880
Can you promise me?

00:30:25.470 --> 00:30:27.050
That you'll never take it off

00:30:40.550 --> 00:30:43.320
I'll do my best to put you back where you belong

00:30:45.390 --> 00:30:46.400
So,

00:30:48.310 --> 00:30:49.570
please wait

00:30:51.940 --> 00:30:54.240
I know how you feel

00:30:55.100 --> 00:30:56.910
so you have no reason to rush

00:30:58.950 --> 00:31:00.760
I'm fine

00:31:31.390 --> 00:31:32.450
Wang

00:31:34.320 --> 00:31:35.330
Uk

00:31:38.920 --> 00:31:41.200
Rising sun in the morning, Uk

00:32:23.880 --> 00:32:26.840
Even the words “wait for me” can make a person happy

00:32:28.930 --> 00:32:30.390
I like him

00:32:31.610 --> 00:32:33.370
If I were with him

00:32:34.320 --> 00:32:38.270
I think it would be great to be Hae Soo instead of Go Ha Jin

00:32:46.390 --> 00:32:49.920
You could live well

00:32:51.460 --> 00:32:52.580
Hae Soo

00:33:17.260 --> 00:33:18.400
Kids

00:33:23.380 --> 00:33:24.730
Thank you

00:33:24.730 --> 00:33:26.760
- Eat slowly
- Yes, sir

00:33:46.630 --> 00:33:48.780
What are you doing?!

00:33:48.780 --> 00:33:50.750
Do you think we look like pigs?

00:33:50.750 --> 00:33:51.790
What?

00:33:51.790 --> 00:33:55.020
Maybe we are lost to Goryeo and also suffering from drought

00:33:55.020 --> 00:33:56.640
But we're still people

00:33:57.210 --> 00:33:59.490
Don't you dare think that you can look down on us

00:34:00.660 --> 00:34:03.060
But...

00:34:03.060 --> 00:34:05.590
I just wanted to show what drought does to people.

00:34:05.590 --> 00:34:09.080
For the Goryeo aristocrats who live in wealth, this is not enough

00:34:09.080 --> 00:34:11.800
I heard they keep such dirty and vile drawings

00:34:12.750 --> 00:34:14.780
All of you are fixated on your life

00:34:14.780 --> 00:34:17.550
And you mock the suffering of ordinary people

00:34:18.350 --> 00:34:20.860
You sold your pride to the authorities

00:34:21.700 --> 00:34:22.850
You are pathetic insects

00:34:25.210 --> 00:34:26.390
Insects?

00:34:27.540 --> 00:34:30.490
Hey you, stop!

00:34:44.970 --> 00:34:46.090
Your Highness

00:34:49.830 --> 00:34:50.920
General

00:34:53.190 --> 00:34:56.830
What a blessing that you look so good

00:34:56.830 --> 00:34:59.310
The Minister of Foreign Affairs wishes to see you, Your Highness

00:34:59.310 --> 00:35:00.450
Minister?

00:35:02.510 --> 00:35:06.110
Has this traitor Park Yong Gyu become Foreign Minister already?

00:35:06.110 --> 00:35:08.110
High he rose

00:35:09.020 --> 00:35:11.490
Okay, let's go

00:35:11.490 --> 00:35:12.550
Here

00:35:23.140 --> 00:35:26.230
Did she create the misunderstanding and then disappear?

00:35:28.930 --> 00:35:30.710
Is she a refugee?

00:35:32.670 --> 00:35:35.030
Okay, now let's have a drink!

00:35:35.030 --> 00:35:36.360
- Yes, Crown Prince!
- Yes, Crown Prince!

00:35:51.230 --> 00:35:55.060
Eun, you are a year older. Let me pour you a drink

00:35:55.060 --> 00:35:57.140
Thank you for your congratulations

00:36:05.930 --> 00:36:08.100
Brother, we'll pour you a drink too

00:36:08.100 --> 00:36:09.470
Yes, of course

00:36:09.470 --> 00:36:11.680
What kind of drink is this?

00:36:12.240 --> 00:36:13.340
Yong Hwa

00:36:13.340 --> 00:36:16.960
It was you who organized the meeting for us. I can't even imagine what will happen tonight

00:36:16.960 --> 00:36:18.680
I was very happy

00:36:18.680 --> 00:36:22.350
Since I'm getting married and leaving this place soon, I won't be able to gather you all like this anymore.

00:36:22.350 --> 00:36:26.140
Are you getting married? When?

00:36:26.670 --> 00:36:31.420
The Emperor is looking for a powerful family somewhere far from Songak

00:36:33.130 --> 00:36:35.460
Not even a royal family, just a powerful one

00:36:35.460 --> 00:36:36.990
What nonsense

00:36:36.990 --> 00:36:40.500
I guess I'm not good enough for the royal family to want me

00:36:43.040 --> 00:36:46.240
Let's discuss this with mother later

00:36:53.070 --> 00:36:55.250
One more time. Drink to the bottom

00:36:55.250 --> 00:36:56.730
Wait, what is this?

00:36:57.880 --> 00:37:01.000
Why is it only me who has the cup?

00:37:02.860 --> 00:37:04.210
This can't be true

00:37:04.860 --> 00:37:07.090
You should drink it all too

00:37:07.090 --> 00:37:08.700
Wait. These people...

00:37:09.580 --> 00:37:12.300
Isn't this a different drink?

00:37:14.310 --> 00:37:17.740
- Mommies!
- You drink so well!

00:37:18.690 --> 00:37:20.620
What a wonderful day

00:37:21.280 --> 00:37:22.810
I guess I'll go

00:37:24.550 --> 00:37:26.640
One more. Here

00:37:28.100 --> 00:37:29.200
And drink some water

00:37:31.180 --> 00:37:33.370
What important thing did you want to talk to me about?

00:37:33.870 --> 00:37:36.410
You... just be mine

00:37:37.100 --> 00:37:39.620
- What?
-You can be the Empress of Goryeo

00:37:39.620 --> 00:37:41.280
Mistress of a powerful house?

00:37:41.280 --> 00:37:43.060
I won't be able to look at this

00:37:44.930 --> 00:37:48.390
Then how far do your dreams go, brother?

00:37:48.390 --> 00:37:49.520
My dreams?

00:37:52.410 --> 00:37:55.470
Even in such a hopeless situation you need arguments

00:37:57.160 --> 00:37:58.490
My dream is

00:38:00.590 --> 00:38:01.700
this is Goryeo

00:38:04.090 --> 00:38:06.270
You are fearless

00:38:07.290 --> 00:38:10.290
I know you want Uk to take the throne

00:38:10.710 --> 00:38:14.560
Even if your brother takes over, you will only be a princess

00:38:16.140 --> 00:38:18.810
But if the emperor is your husband, that changes things radically.

00:38:18.810 --> 00:38:22.010
And yet, I will not be the first wife and will not be able to become an empress

00:38:25.130 --> 00:38:29.500
Can you dissolve your previous marriage for my sake?

00:38:31.840 --> 00:38:35.370
I won't give up what's mine to win a girl

00:38:44.620 --> 00:38:45.990
Let go

00:38:47.880 --> 00:38:52.100
Do you have other options?

00:38:58.340 --> 00:39:00.000
Aren't you tired of this?

00:39:03.970 --> 00:39:06.350
You live like a vile coward

00:39:06.850 --> 00:39:08.710
You should be tired of this by now

00:39:09.790 --> 00:39:11.660
You're too persistent

00:39:11.660 --> 00:39:15.480
And you keep poking your nose into things that aren't yours.

00:39:17.500 --> 00:39:18.730
Let's talk later

00:39:26.180 --> 00:39:27.410
Thank you

00:39:29.410 --> 00:39:32.640
Please don't tell Wook about this

00:39:33.230 --> 00:39:36.820
Get Wang Yeo out of your thoughts

00:39:37.490 --> 00:39:40.050
You won't get what you want from him.

00:39:41.710 --> 00:39:43.320
This is a stupid calculation

00:39:44.110 --> 00:39:47.840
If you want to warn me, suggest a better option

00:39:50.110 --> 00:39:55.390
Would you like me to consider you as a candidate?

00:40:16.500 --> 00:40:19.390
Mrs. Oh, I finished everything you talked about

00:40:20.190 --> 00:40:21.400
You can go

00:40:21.400 --> 00:40:24.160
I'm letting you go because the Crown Prince personally asked

00:40:24.160 --> 00:40:25.660
- Do you understand?
- Yes

00:41:29.380 --> 00:41:31.680
I know the way home

00:41:37.900 --> 00:41:39.040
Prince!

00:41:41.570 --> 00:41:43.040
It's you, Hae Soo!

00:41:49.490 --> 00:41:51.790
Why are you so beautiful today?

00:41:55.730 --> 00:41:59.900
Oh, two Hae Soos. No, not even three

00:41:59.900 --> 00:42:02.200
Hae Soo is everywhere!

00:42:02.200 --> 00:42:03.420
Oh man

00:42:04.070 --> 00:42:05.680
Follow me

00:42:05.680 --> 00:42:07.210
Where are you going?

00:42:07.210 --> 00:42:08.910
Where is everyone?

00:42:08.910 --> 00:42:12.830
Brother, everyone went to have fun, but they didn’t tell us?

00:42:12.830 --> 00:42:14.150
You should be happy

00:42:14.150 --> 00:42:16.170
I'm worried they'll make trouble

00:42:17.260 --> 00:42:18.680
Move over please

00:42:18.680 --> 00:42:20.200
What is this?

00:42:22.050 --> 00:42:24.360
Are you Soon Deok? Park Soon Deok?

00:42:24.360 --> 00:42:26.120
Brother, do you know this bear?

00:42:26.120 --> 00:42:29.500
This is General Park's daughter, Soon Deok

00:42:30.520 --> 00:42:31.590
Daughter?

00:42:44.540 --> 00:42:45.920
Wow

00:42:46.530 --> 00:42:48.620
Wow!

00:42:49.170 --> 00:42:51.230
Is that me?

00:42:51.230 --> 00:42:52.540
Yes

00:42:56.270 --> 00:42:58.370
Su, did you do all this?

00:42:59.320 --> 00:43:00.520
Prince

00:43:00.830 --> 00:43:04.330
Thank you for being my first friend in Goryeo

00:43:05.810 --> 00:43:10.500
After my sister's death, I came to my senses thanks to you.

00:43:14.290 --> 00:43:18.920
So I want to give you something special

00:43:21.520 --> 00:43:26.880
Happy birthday to you
Happy birthday to you

00:43:26.880 --> 00:43:32.800
My friend, Prince 10th
Happy birthday to you

00:43:34.720 --> 00:43:39.010
Why were you born?
Why were you born?

00:43:39.010 --> 00:43:44.320
You're so scary
Why were you born?

00:43:44.320 --> 00:43:46.280
Why were you born?

00:43:46.780 --> 00:43:49.070
Why were you born?

00:43:49.070 --> 00:43:51.290
Why were you born?

00:43:51.830 --> 00:43:54.550
Why were you born?

00:43:55.670 --> 00:44:00.620
You're so scary
Why were you born?

00:44:03.330 --> 00:44:07.140
Brother! And you allowed yourself to enjoy it alone?

00:44:07.140 --> 00:44:09.000
- You broke my heart
- What are you doing here?

00:44:09.000 --> 00:44:11.150
Sister, will you sing for my birthday?

00:44:11.150 --> 00:44:14.550
Beck A is right. Were you going to enjoy it yourself?

00:44:14.550 --> 00:44:16.140
You can't kick me out

00:44:16.140 --> 00:44:18.650
It was I who asked Concubine Oh to send Hae Soo

00:44:18.650 --> 00:44:21.920
You know, you're better than a gisaeng

00:44:22.420 --> 00:44:24.070
- Hey you
- Well, you

00:44:26.190 --> 00:44:28.300
I meant she's good

00:44:28.800 --> 00:44:31.990
Little sister, can you sing for us too?

00:44:31.990 --> 00:44:33.210
No, it can't

00:44:33.210 --> 00:44:34.500
Yes, sing it

00:44:34.500 --> 00:44:36.670
- Please sing
- One time

00:44:36.670 --> 00:44:38.070
She can't!

00:44:38.070 --> 00:44:40.590
Why are you ruining my gift?

00:44:40.590 --> 00:44:42.200
- Su, please sing
- Sing, Su

00:44:42.200 --> 00:44:44.800
- Yes, come on
- No! Leave everyone!

00:44:44.800 --> 00:44:47.840
Why are you taking my gift?

00:44:47.840 --> 00:44:48.950
Well, it's true!

00:45:03.200 --> 00:45:08.020
Those days that were filled with pain

00:45:08.770 --> 00:45:13.290
I remember in windless silence

00:45:14.050 --> 00:45:20.590
And I smile because I love the sunshine

00:45:22.900 --> 00:45:27.720
Together with the worries they went away

00:45:28.330 --> 00:45:32.960
Even surrounded by heartless people

00:45:33.930 --> 00:45:40.810
And I smile because I love my friends

00:45:42.860 --> 00:45:49.760
If I find a place that isn't filled with loneliness,

00:45:52.500 --> 00:45:58.460
come to that place with me

00:45:59.350 --> 00:46:04.910
Let's go together, friend

00:46:04.910 --> 00:46:08.900
My friend...

00:46:56.850 --> 00:46:58.730
Wow!

00:46:58.730 --> 00:47:00.670
Sister!

00:47:01.710 --> 00:47:03.720
Su, you are beautiful!

00:47:29.740 --> 00:47:31.990
I'm still waiting for my gifts

00:47:31.990 --> 00:47:34.450
You'll have to look for them

00:47:34.450 --> 00:47:37.710
- Be careful
- They're so cute, aren't they?

00:47:42.350 --> 00:47:45.040
- You can go now
- What?

00:47:45.960 --> 00:47:50.400
You made the 10th prince happy. You can consider your maid's work done

00:47:50.400 --> 00:47:51.720
Well done

00:47:51.720 --> 00:47:53.820
I didn't do this because I'm a maid

00:47:54.180 --> 00:47:56.300
Before that, me and Eun...

00:47:56.300 --> 00:47:58.630
You're not going to say you were friends, are you?

00:47:58.630 --> 00:48:00.940
A prince who is friends with a maid?

00:48:00.940 --> 00:48:03.350
How ridiculous will Eun look?

00:48:05.370 --> 00:48:08.800
I was the party organizer, so I'll take care of everything.

00:48:08.800 --> 00:48:11.670
You've already helped enough, go

00:48:14.800 --> 00:48:16.450
I told you to go

00:48:16.450 --> 00:48:18.790
As always, you are in your repertoire, princess

00:48:18.790 --> 00:48:21.640
Look at the status, not the person

00:48:22.440 --> 00:48:25.600
You haven't changed since you beat up Chae Ryung

00:48:25.600 --> 00:48:28.120
Are there any reasons for this?

00:48:28.120 --> 00:48:32.190
I was nice to you because of Myung Hee

00:48:33.220 --> 00:48:34.930
You should know your place

00:48:35.930 --> 00:48:37.660
I told you everything's fine

00:48:40.850 --> 00:48:41.970
Crown Prince

00:48:41.970 --> 00:48:45.780
Eun enjoys her time with Hae Soo. So I invited her as a gift

00:48:47.200 --> 00:48:51.250
I'm not a very good brother, I couldn't think of another gift

00:48:51.250 --> 00:48:53.020
Yong Hwa, please understand

00:48:54.020 --> 00:48:55.990
I understand you

00:48:57.270 --> 00:48:59.420
She even has the crown prince's affection

00:48:59.420 --> 00:49:01.970
She's a real lucky girl

00:49:12.570 --> 00:49:14.490
Thank you Your Highness

00:49:14.490 --> 00:49:18.630
You saw my illness. It's the least I can do for you

00:49:18.630 --> 00:49:20.490
I didn't tell anyone about this

00:49:20.490 --> 00:49:22.550
I know. I trust you

00:49:23.120 --> 00:49:26.120
Will you help me in the future when needed?

00:49:26.490 --> 00:49:30.040
Of course I'll do my best

00:49:30.910 --> 00:49:32.440
- Wonderful!
- Like?

00:49:32.440 --> 00:49:34.460
I really like it

00:49:34.460 --> 00:49:36.700
Is this jade?

00:49:36.700 --> 00:49:38.020
It's very heavy

00:49:38.020 --> 00:49:39.430
And darling

00:49:41.340 --> 00:49:44.370
Slingshot

00:49:46.310 --> 00:49:47.990
Brother, I prepared this gift

00:49:52.660 --> 00:49:56.550
Isn't this a book? Book!

00:49:56.550 --> 00:49:57.870
Book?

00:49:58.590 --> 00:50:01.440
Who will read it? Why did you bring the book?

00:50:01.440 --> 00:50:03.090
I'll shoot you with a slingshot

00:50:03.090 --> 00:50:04.500
But she's very precious

00:50:04.500 --> 00:50:06.480
I like the slingshot the most

00:50:18.880 --> 00:50:20.240
Your Highness

00:50:23.650 --> 00:50:24.960
Your Highness

00:50:26.670 --> 00:50:29.950
Who are you? Grim Reaper?

00:50:29.950 --> 00:50:33.240
This is General Park's daughter - Sun Deok

00:50:33.240 --> 00:50:34.340
Don't you know her?

00:50:36.810 --> 00:50:38.220
Soon Deok!

00:50:45.410 --> 00:50:47.730
- God!
- This skin...

00:50:49.720 --> 00:50:51.250
This is for you

00:50:51.950 --> 00:50:54.580
Wait, are you the one who scares me with a bear skin every year?

00:50:54.580 --> 00:50:56.080
Why are you doing this to me?

00:50:56.340 --> 00:50:59.930
Higher Highness! It's not like that

00:51:01.120 --> 00:51:02.440
It's not like that

00:51:12.160 --> 00:51:14.370
How can someone be so annoying?

00:52:00.000 --> 00:52:03.080
The prince is with me! Why am I alone?

00:52:18.000 --> 00:52:19.760
Why are you alone again?

00:52:19.760 --> 00:52:21.670
On a day like this we should be together

00:52:23.090 --> 00:52:24.370
You better leave

00:52:24.780 --> 00:52:27.150
I don't like to be in crowded and noisy places

00:52:27.150 --> 00:52:30.420
Are your relatives yours for a reason?

00:52:30.420 --> 00:52:32.660
We need to congratulate them on days like these

00:52:32.660 --> 00:52:33.720
Let's go

00:52:34.640 --> 00:52:35.800
Let's go

00:52:38.020 --> 00:52:39.890
I don't want to be a burden

00:52:39.890 --> 00:52:41.480
Hurry up. Let's go

00:52:44.880 --> 00:52:47.480
So, what did So give you?

00:52:47.480 --> 00:52:49.150
Forget it

00:52:49.150 --> 00:52:52.110
It was a surprise to me that the 4th brother came at all

00:52:52.110 --> 00:52:53.240
How bad

00:52:53.270 --> 00:52:57.470
There is a unique gift that only So could give you

00:52:58.170 --> 00:52:59.270
What a pity

00:53:03.150 --> 00:53:05.030
Is there such a gift?

00:53:11.950 --> 00:53:15.440
What? He wouldn't give me this

00:53:16.700 --> 00:53:17.820
Su!

00:53:20.700 --> 00:53:24.000
You are close to the 4th prince. Can you help me get my gift?

00:53:24.000 --> 00:53:26.350
And what gift do you want?

00:53:26.350 --> 00:53:30.740
He won't give up that easily. We should get together

00:53:30.740 --> 00:53:33.440
Su, please. Let's go, Su!

00:53:33.440 --> 00:53:35.280
Okay, okay

00:53:35.280 --> 00:53:37.010
Let's go. Faster

00:53:45.770 --> 00:53:47.250
Where have you been?

00:53:47.660 --> 00:53:49.920
We all gave Eun gifts here

00:53:52.780 --> 00:53:56.890
I didn't have time to prepare anything

00:53:58.400 --> 00:54:00.730
Tell me if you want anything

00:54:02.080 --> 00:54:04.800
And will you give me anything?

00:54:04.800 --> 00:54:08.880
Certainly. How can the 4th prince go back on his words?

00:54:08.880 --> 00:54:11.000
He will get it even if it is

00:54:11.000 --> 00:54:13.120
priceless and will be hard to find, right?

00:54:18.160 --> 00:54:21.960
Yes, don't forget to choose something like this

00:54:21.960 --> 00:54:23.860
I'll definitely find this for you

00:54:23.860 --> 00:54:25.690
Do you really promise?

00:54:25.690 --> 00:54:26.830
I told you

00:54:26.830 --> 00:54:30.880
Then show your face without a mask!

00:54:38.420 --> 00:54:41.140
I only heard from others, I was always curious

00:54:41.140 --> 00:54:44.010
We are brothers, not strangers. Why hide?

00:54:44.650 --> 00:54:48.380
I really wonder how bad it is there, since you hide it

00:54:48.380 --> 00:54:49.850
Prince, wait...

00:54:49.850 --> 00:54:52.280
How dare a maid interfere?!

00:54:54.590 --> 00:54:55.880
Don't pay attention

00:55:00.180 --> 00:55:03.180
Do you want... to see him?

00:55:03.180 --> 00:55:05.560
- Brother
- That's enough

00:55:06.360 --> 00:55:09.880
Eun, you need to have at least a drop of shame
and don't want something like that

00:55:09.880 --> 00:55:12.240
He said he'll give me whatever I want

00:55:12.720 --> 00:55:14.520
Hae Soo, you said the same thing

00:55:14.520 --> 00:55:17.440
She said that Wang So will definitely give him a gift.

00:55:17.440 --> 00:55:20.680
What? That's not what I meant...

00:55:20.680 --> 00:55:21.750
Forget it

00:56:55.330 --> 00:56:56.640
Brother!

00:57:14.460 --> 00:57:16.670
Apologize to So now

00:57:16.670 --> 00:57:18.610
You made a mistake

00:57:18.610 --> 00:57:21.940
You told me to ask for it and this is what happened!

00:57:21.940 --> 00:57:23.880
I didn't say anything bad

00:57:23.880 --> 00:57:26.170
I just said it was an unforgettable gift.

00:57:26.900 --> 00:57:29.080
This may seem like fun to you

00:57:29.600 --> 00:57:31.350
But not for So!

00:57:33.330 --> 00:57:36.520
If he doesn't like it so much, don't take off his mask.

00:57:37.050 --> 00:57:38.990
Too proud

00:57:40.150 --> 00:57:43.180
Everyone has a weak spot

00:57:43.180 --> 00:57:46.260
Why do you always target people's weak points?

00:57:46.260 --> 00:57:47.400
Me?

00:57:47.400 --> 00:57:52.110
So, when I noted that your wife's family is of low origin,

00:57:52.110 --> 00:57:55.970
and asked what nerves must be in order to remain crown prince,

00:57:55.970 --> 00:57:57.990
did you feel offended?

00:58:01.030 --> 00:58:02.860
You throw words around so carelessly

00:58:03.770 --> 00:58:05.900
Teach a lesson about what not to do?

00:58:11.600 --> 00:58:12.710
Prince!

00:58:15.960 --> 00:58:17.160
Prince!

00:58:18.580 --> 00:58:20.780
Wait... wait!

00:58:22.780 --> 00:58:24.210
Is this not enough?

00:58:24.210 --> 00:58:27.120
What? Want to have even more fun?!

00:58:27.120 --> 00:58:29.810
It's all wrong, it's a misunderstanding

00:58:29.810 --> 00:58:31.690
Don't leave!

00:58:32.190 --> 00:58:33.450
If you leave like this,

00:58:33.450 --> 00:58:35.610
The 10th Prince will lose his chance to apologize

00:58:35.610 --> 00:58:37.500
And you will grow apart

00:58:39.620 --> 00:58:41.930
You're brothers, right?

00:58:45.350 --> 00:58:46.630
Prince

00:58:54.430 --> 00:58:55.550
Look at me

00:58:57.980 --> 00:58:59.700
Take a good look!

00:59:09.150 --> 00:59:10.370
Your eyes...

00:59:13.310 --> 00:59:14.750
This look...

00:59:23.050 --> 00:59:25.270
I hate it to death

00:59:31.730 --> 00:59:38.550
Thanks for watching with us!
